  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network of Business Membership Organisations in the Mediterranean and Gulf countries (Confederation of Danish Industry; DI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim was to increase and consolidate the capacity of democratic and representative industrial organisations in the MENA region and thereby promote reforms for democracy, improved entrepreneurial environment and formalisation of the labour market, which can lead to a more inclusive economic growth and job creation. 

Furthermore the project has targeted the establishment of sustainable partnerships between partners and the central political stakeholders as well as the development of common educational platforms and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
